[statement]
A package not installed, whose condition names a package placed, leads the
walk to the package installed that provides its name: placing `o` reaches
`md`, which is not installed, and `bmo` provides `md`, so `bmo` follows
`o`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:ac bmo

P:ac
V:1
D:o

P:bmo
V:1
p:md

P:md
V:1
i:o mdevd

P:o
V:1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install o 1
install bmo 1
install ac 1
install top 1
